    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't really have time to go to the doctor right now lol im swamped with work. if it's just ringworm, can i just use some hydrocortisone or an antifungal cream like clotrimazole? i think i have some old stuff in my cabinet. do u think that would work to clear it up pretty fast?",
